# Copy to .env.local and fill in from your Supabase project:
#   Dashboard -> Project Settings -> Data API  (URL)
#   Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API Keys  (anon / publishable key)
#
# Both are safe to expose in the browser bundle — the anon key is a public
# identifier, not a secret. Row level security (supabase/schema.sql) is what
# keeps each account's data private. Never put the SERVICE ROLE key here.
#
# Leave these unset to run the app fully local, with no sign-in.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
